.nh
.TH "PB-DOMAIN-SHOW" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-domain-show - Show a domain's DNS records, status and uses


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb domain show <domain> [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Show a domain's DNS records, status and uses

.PP
Show one domain's DNS records, verification and certificate state, the exact fix for a failed check, and the hostnames that use it.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for show

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print JSON


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-domain(1)\fP
